Myriad modifications:
- ESM factory with isolated state/IDs; no window/global API or SSR DOM work.
- Smoked dark transmission and lighter chrome transmission; no bloom blur.
- Stretch private filter regions/images during resize; rebuild after settling
  without temporarily replacing the lens with blur.
- Target the rim alpha node explicitly during materialization.
- Geometry refreshes reuse settled filters without rewriting unchanged URLs.
- Cancel/remove transient filters on refresh, detach and disposal; clear caches
  and SVG host on disposal.

The optical algorithm remains recognizable for upstream comparison. This
vendored directory is excluded from automatic formatting/lint rewriting.
Browser engine detection and elliptical/percentage corner approximations
retain upstream limitations; browser rendering must be verified separately.
